        </ids:property>
        <ids:property instructions="HollowCorePlugging || from IFC documentation: A descriptive label for how the hollow core ends are treated: they may be left open, closed with a plug, or sealed with cast concrete. Values would be, for example: 'Unplugged', 'Plugged', 'SealedWithConcrete'. This property applies to  hollow core slabs only." dataType="IFCLABEL">
