        <ids:property instructions="Twisting || from IFC documentation: The angle, in radians, through which the end face of a precast piece is rotated with respect to its starting face, along its longitudinal axis, as a result of non-aligned supports. This measure is also termed the warping angle." dataType="IFCPLANEANGLEMEASURE">
