        <ids:property instructions="Reference || from IFC documentation: Reference ID for this specified type in this project (e.g. type 'A-1'), Also referred to as &quot;construction type&quot;. It should be provided as an alternative to the name of the &quot;object type&quot;, if the software does not support object types and no classification reference to a recognized classification system used.IFC4.3.0.0 DEPRECATION  The Reference property is deprecated and shall no longer be used, use attribute Name on the relating type instead." dataType="IFCLABEL">
