        </ids:property>
        <ids:property instructions="ArticleNumber || from IFC documentation: Article number or reference that is be applied to a configured product according to a standard scheme for article number definition as defined by the manufacturer. It is often used as the purchasing number." dataType="IFCIDENTIFIER">
